@host = http://localhost:5227
@accessToken =
@projectId =
@memberUserId =
@suggestionId =

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Login with dev domain credentials

### Copy accessToken from the response body to the @accessToken variable above.
# The response must also set refreshToken as an HttpOnly cookie.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.local",
  "password": "password"
}

### Get current user from JWT
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Refresh access token from HttpOnly cookie
# This request has no body. The refreshToken must be sent by the HTTP client from cookie storage.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Accept: application/json

### Logout and remove refresh cookie
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Accept: application/json

### Negative check: login validation error
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": ""
}

### Negative check: protected endpoint without access token
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/me
Accept: application/json

### Add project member
### Requires @accessToken of a user who is Admin in @projectId.
### Use @memberUserId from GET /api/v1/users after BE-3 is implemented.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "userId": "{{memberUserId}}",
  "role": "Member"
}

### Negative check: add the same project member again returns 409 Conflict
POST {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "userId": "{{memberUserId}}",
  "role": "Member"
}

### Change project member role
# Allowed roles: Member, Admin.
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/members/{{memberUserId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "role": "Admin"
}

### Remove project member
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/members/{{memberUserId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Negative check: project member operation without Admin role returns 403 Forbidden
### Login as a non-admin project member, copy that token to @accessToken, then run this request.
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/members/{{memberUserId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "role": "Member"
}

### Get project suggestions with default business sorting
### Requires @accessToken of a user who is a member of @projectId.
### Default sorting is score DESC, createdAt ASC.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/suggestions
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get project suggestions with filters, sorting and pagination
### Allowed status values: New, InProgress, Accepted, Rejected.
### Allowed sort values: createdAt, updatedAt, score.
### Allowed order values: asc, desc.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/suggestions?status=New&search=retro&sort=score&order=desc&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create suggestion
### Copy id from the response body to the @suggestionId variable above.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/suggestions
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "text": "Add a lightweight retrospective template before team meetings"
}

### Negative check: create suggestion validation error
POST {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/suggestions
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "text": ""
}

### Get suggestion details
### Response includes votes[] and currentUserVote.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/suggestions/{{suggestionId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update suggestion text
### Requires @accessToken of the suggestion author.
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/suggestions/{{suggestionId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "text": "Add a lightweight retrospective template and an owner for action items"
}

### Negative check: update suggestion text as non-author returns 403 Forbidden
### Login as a different project member, copy that token to @accessToken, then run this request.
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/suggestions/{{suggestionId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "text": "Attempt to edit another user's suggestion"
}

### Update suggestion status
### Requires @accessToken of a user who is Admin in @projectId.
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/suggestions/{{suggestionId}}/status
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "status": "InProgress"
}

### Negative check: update suggestion status without Admin role returns 403 Forbidden
### Login as a non-admin project member, copy that token to @accessToken, then run this request.
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/suggestions/{{suggestionId}}/status
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "status": "Accepted"
}

### Negative check: get missing suggestion returns 404 Not Found
GET {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/suggestions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
